      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOOFY ETHICS (2) was in traffic close to the inside last time over 515m at Gosford and fell. Has the ability and looks a key chance. CUMBRIA CHRISSY (5) is a last start placegetter in Grade 3/4 company, jumping from this box and finishing a 1.3 lengths second over 400m at Bulli. Has a very honest record from this same draw, including a win and two minors. Should be in this for a long way. BILLY RAY'S GIRL (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (29.98) at this track behind My Cupcake in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Bold showing expected. FEARLESS BANDIT (4) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
